    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "栈的定义和 LIFO"
            }
          ],
          "role": "body",
          "shape_index": 0,
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "栈（Stack）只允许在同一端插入与删除。"
            },
            {
              "index": 1,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "该端叫栈顶 top；另一端叫栈底 bottom。"
            },
            {
              "index": 2,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "栈遵循后进先出（LIFO）。"
            }
          ],
          "role": "body",
          "shape_index": 1,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "slide_index": 1,
      "slide_number": 2,
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "栈的基本操作"
            }
          ],
          "role": "body",
          "shape_index": 0,
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "push(x)：将元素 x 压入栈顶。"
            },
            {
              "index": 1,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "pop()：移除栈顶元素。"
            },
            {
              "index": 2,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "top()：读取栈顶但不移除。"
            }
          ],
          "role": "body",
          "shape_index": 1,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "slide_index": 2,
      "slide_number": 3,
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "空栈、边界与验证"
            }
          ],
          "role": "body",
          "shape_index": 0,
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "index": 0,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "对空栈调用 pop() 必须返回明确的下溢错误或失败状态。"
            },
            {
              "index": 1,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "顺序栈若容量固定，入栈时应检测栈满。"
            },
            {
              "index": 2,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "例：依次 push(4)、push(9)、pop()、push(2)，最终 top 为 2。"
            },
            {
              "index": 3,
              "level": 0,
              "text": "掌握标准：不借助动画独立跟踪栈内容。"
            }
          ],
          "role": "body",
          "shape_index": 1,
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
